flowchart LR

CLIENT["`CLIENT
React app · Postman`"]

TRAEFIK["`TRAEFIK — the single entry point
everything comes in through it
terminates TLS · routes by hostname
attaches the REAL client IP so the
logger and rate limiter see the true
address, not the proxy's`"]

MW["`MIDDLEWARE CHAIN
access management and
cross-cutting concerns`"]

MODS["`13 MODULES
all with the same architecture
and the same internal shape`"]

WORKER["`CELERY — async side
runs from the SAME image as the API
RAG document ingestion
study-plan generation`"]

GATEWAY["`AI GATEWAY
the single door for every LLM call
fallback chain · model split by task
different costs per tier`"]

BEDROCK["`AMAZON BEDROCK
Claude · Nova · OpenAI
three model families,
one integration`"]

PGB["`PgBouncer
connection pooler
in front of the database`"]

PG["`PostgreSQL
vector-enabled database
SQLAlchemy + Alembic`"]

REDIS["`REDIS — four jobs,
four separate logical spaces
cache · Celery broker
counters · rate limiter`"]

MINIO["`MinIO
file storage, S3's twin
files never touch the database`"]

OLLAMA["`OLLAMA — local
bge-m3 for embeddings
llama3.2 as the last LLM fallback`"]

NET["`INTERNAL DOCKER NETWORK
the data layer lives isolated from
the outside world — never exposed
to the host · frontal network only
between Traefik and the API`"]

OBS["`OBSERVABILITY STACK
metrics · logs · traces
system-wide health AND the
behaviour of a single request`"]

CLIENT -->|"HTTPS"| TRAEFIK
TRAEFIK -->|"forwards inside"| MW
MW --> MODS
MODS -->|"owner-scoped SQL"| PGB
PGB --> PG
MODS --> REDIS
MODS -->|"files"| MINIO
REDIS -->|"delivers queued work"| WORKER
WORKER --> PG
WORKER --> MINIO
MODS -->|"every AI call"| GATEWAY
WORKER -->|"every AI call"| GATEWAY
GATEWAY --> BEDROCK
GATEWAY -->|"local floor"| OLLAMA
PG -.- NET
REDIS -.- NET
MINIO -.- NET
OLLAMA -.- NET
MW -.->|"signals"| OBS
WORKER -.->|"signals"| OBS
GATEWAY -.->|"signals"| OBS

